# L-SDF Index: js/ui
# Subsystem: User Interface Components, Floating Docks, Modals & Navigation

§ UI_SUBSYSTEM
├── ◈ modal.js               :: ModalManager (unified pin, text, area, and connection dialogs)
├── ◈ tray.js                :: TrayManager (bottom evidence card dock & tray slots)
├── ◈ toolbar.js             :: ToolbarManager (top tool family bar, palette selector, themes)
├── ◈ boardPicker.js         :: BoardPickerUI (board browser modal, thumbnail cards, search)
└── ◈ systemMenu.js          :: SystemMenuManager (top-left board controls, new/open/export)
